      "line": 459,
      "verdict": "verified in exact local source",
      "hypothesis_translation": "The kernel of the actual residue homomorphism Z_p -> ZMod(p^n) is the principal ideal generated by p^n; used to prove faithful integer divisibility and truncation precision."
    },
    {
      "path": "Mathlib/NumberTheory/Padics/RingHoms.lean",
